  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A mesh produce bag is an open-mesh drawstring bag in fingering cotton: worked in the round from a small base, with a simple chain-1 mesh throughout and a larger chain-3 "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "drawstring channel",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "drawstring-channel"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " near the top. The finished bag is 20 × 30 cm. Machine-washable, lightweight, and packs flat. One 50 m ball of fingering cotton makes one bag."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "items": [
            {
              "slug": "crochet-hook",
              "label": "3 mm crochet hook",
              "isOptional": false
            },
            {
              "slug": "tapestry-needle",
              "label": "Tapestry needle",
              "isOptional": false
            },
            {
              "slug": "craft-scissors",
              "label": "Scissors",
              "isOptional": false
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Materials"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "50 m fingering weight cotton. Plus 60 cm of thin cord or twisted cotton twine for the drawstring."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Gauge"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Exact gauge is not critical for a mesh bag. At ch-1 mesh on a 3 mm hook, each mesh square is approx. 0.7 × 0.7 cm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stitches used"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Magic ring (MR)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Chain (ch)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Slip stitch (sl st)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Double crochet (dc). UK term; US equivalent is single crochet (sc)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Base"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "MR: 6 dc. Pull ring closed."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Round 2: 2 dc in each st (12 dc)."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Round 3: *1 dc, 2 dc in next; repeat (18 dc)."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Round 4: *2 dc, 2 dc in next; repeat (24 dc)."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Round 5: *3 dc, 2 dc in next; repeat (30 dc). Sl st to join."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mesh body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Round 6: ch 1, *1 dc in st, ch 1, skip 1 st; repeat from * around (15 mesh spaces). Sl st to ch 1. This starts the open mesh."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Rounds 7, 34: ch 1, *1 dc in dc of previous round, ch 1; repeat from * around (15 mesh spaces per round). Sl st each round. Continue until bag measures approx. 28 cm from base."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Drawstring channel"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Round 35: ch 1, *1 dc in dc, ch 3, skip 1 st; repeat from * around (15 × ch-3 spaces). Sl st. This creates larger spaces for the drawstring cord."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Round 36: 1 dc in each dc and 2 dc in each ch-3 sp around. Sl st. Fasten off."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Weave in ends. Thread the 60 cm cord through the ch-3 drawstring channel spaces, entering and exiting at the same gap so both ends emerge on the same side. Knot the cord ends together."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Care"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Machine-wash on 30°C gentle cycle in a mesh laundry bag to prevent the drawstring cord tangling. Hang to dry."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}